00:14:10.649 --> 00:14:12.551
-Hey, Jimmy,

00:14:12.551 --> 00:14:15.154
the answer may surprise you.
-The answer may surprise you.

00:14:15.154 --> 00:14:16.388
-Yeah.

00:14:16.388 --> 00:14:18.257
-Aah!

00:14:18.257 --> 00:14:21.526
♪♪

00:14:21.526 --> 00:14:24.063
[ Buzzer ]

00:14:24.063 --> 00:14:25.664
-It's false.

00:14:25.664 --> 00:14:26.965
[ Thunder crashes ]

00:14:26.965 --> 00:14:29.868
Okay, so, it's time
for the final question.

00:14:29.868 --> 00:14:32.270
And it comes with a twist.

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:33.838
Excuse me.

00:14:33.838 --> 00:14:36.575
If you answer incorrectly,

00:14:36.575 --> 00:14:39.378
both of your minds
will be blown.

00:14:39.378 --> 00:14:44.350
Shaq, this conundrum is for you.

00:14:50.188 --> 00:14:52.124
[ Audience oohs ]

00:14:52.124 --> 00:14:54.659
-Come on, dude. Come on, dude.

00:14:54.659 --> 00:14:56.695
"Is it pronounced 'gif'
or 'jif'?"

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:01.100
-I know you're not talking
about the peanut butter.

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:03.035
[ Laughter ]

00:15:03.035 --> 00:15:08.473
So you must be talking
about technology.

00:15:08.473 --> 00:15:13.012
I'm going to go with --
Black people say gif.

00:15:13.012 --> 00:15:15.881
It's gif.

00:15:15.881 --> 00:15:18.951
-Okay.
So that's your answer.

00:15:18.951 --> 00:15:21.553
Uh, the answer actually
may surprise you, Shaq,

00:15:21.553 --> 00:15:22.754
believe it or not.

00:15:22.754 --> 00:15:29.861
♪♪

00:15:29.861 --> 00:15:32.030
[ Buzzer ]

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:33.599
[ Laughter ]

00:15:33.599 --> 00:15:37.135
You are wrong.
It is pronounced jif.

00:15:37.135 --> 00:15:38.904
-Jif. Oh, my goodness.

00:15:38.904 --> 00:15:41.640
Shaquille O'Neal, everybody!
The champion.

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:42.841
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:15:42.841 --> 00:15:43.909
You won. You're the champion.
You won.

